# The @rlrml/* packages here are generated from the vendored subtr-actor
# submodule (scripts/ensure-subtr-vendor populates them locally; the Nix web
# build pulls them straight from the submodule flake). Their built output
# (dist/, *.wasm, *.js, *.d.ts, public/, docs/, ...) is NOT committed — only the
# package.json manifests (so the npm lockfile's file: deps resolve) and the
# .subtr-actor-rev marker. Ignore everything, re-include directories so git
# descends, then keep the manifests + marker.
*
!*/
!@rlrml/.subtr-actor-rev
!@rlrml/*/package.json
